      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the Department of Citywide Administrative Services (\"DCAS\") and the Department of Housing Preservation and Development (\"HPD\") receive requests from property owners to modify or remove deed restrictions that limit the use of property purchased from the City; and",
