      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, DCAS or HPD must determine prior to granting a request to modify or remove a deed restriction that it is in the best interest of the City to modify or remove such restriction in that the purpose for which the restriction was imposed no longer applies and the City no longer benefits from the restriction; and",
